      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Minor copy and formatting changes.",
        "text_sha256": "7d2988377f53d02f7193cf6ab583f88affc395511d89bb136bcb32b1b81e3b97",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "goodie bag ideas",
        "text_sha256": "a28ba4eef589fb3dbd59fba966cdfd105260843092b532de9c6ffb6b1052a53c",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Wondering what to put in a goodie bag for your tot's next birthday party? These party favor ideas are sure to wow your pint-sized party guests (and their parents).",
        "text_sha256": "dd24b516dab53e5f9ded72f6be205fbffeb93637d46b04818b21655310e507b5",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "With all the planning it takes to coordinate a spectacular birthday party for your little one and his pals, the goodie bag can feel like a bit of an afterthought. But stuffing a favor bag with trinkets that self-destruct after five minutes is a money-waster for you and disappointing for the critters. Instead, wow your littlest guests with these smart suggestions for what to include in a goodie bag.",
        "text_sha256": "86d17daee65428b0c02041e9cc5c5a791e59a3ac9146137a066da7ab824c3982",
        "word_count": 69
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What should you put in a toddler goodie bag?",
        "text_sha256": "cc9422a37448a90e81e0f8ffcca45c3bdd77af661ae43bd75999b8539be15aa3",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Building a goodie bag? You've got a lot of choices, which can be overwhelming. The trick to creating a fun goodie bag is to think about items that kids will actually use with when they get home, whether that's small toys, non-toxic craft supplies (crayons are always a hit) or little treats that will make them smile (when in doubt, get some stickers). Trusted SourceAmerican Academy of PediatricsToy Buying Tips for Babies & Young Children: AAP Report ExplainedSee All Sources [1]",
        "text_sha256": "b454adf8df1e0ed568b3105dcc5ed2664ce89529d2bb52d73cfa188f9b7e2661",
        "word_count": 81
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceAmerican Academy of PediatricsToy Buying Tips for Babies & Young Children: AAP Report ExplainedSee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "5a8db3b8b132ea2346ac33217ecf3d3c95c5fcc26c879a43df4407d1d8068eca",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here's your buying guide for the littlest years: ages 1, 2 and 3.",
        "text_sha256": "34f8c6013793d35967d276d8fb2c2252942e80d59975eb2c619269616b7f7718",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Goodie bag ideas for a 1-year-old's birthday party",
        "text_sha256": "4268055c3d40366e2c82d2ffa34bfa7c2c05803dae19d935c07bd3c43a43150d",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Newly-minted toddlers are too young to expect a goodie bag, but you can still send guests home with one of these fun party favors that tots will get a kick out of (and parents will appreciate, too).",
        "text_sha256": "a508dacec5775d6165b520be7a6d5e6d6728de7f80ed77ba84a18ffdbd87f97d",
