      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Many of the favors that would work for a 2-year-old's treat bag could also go into a 3-year-old's, but with this age group you can also consider toys and activities that require more advanced motor skills or emphasize imaginative play. Trusted SourceZero to ThreeTips for Choosing Toys for ToddlersSee All Sources [2]",
